// Dialogue for the C host example. Exercises every event kind the host handles:
// NodeStarted, Line, Command, Options, NodeComplete, DialogueComplete.

title: Tavern
---
<<declare $gold = 12>>

Innkeeper: Evening. You look like you walked a long road. #line:inn_greet
<<play_music "tavern_theme">>

-> A room for the night, please.
    Innkeeper: Six gold, and the stew is free.
    <<set $gold = $gold - 6>>
    Innkeeper: Sleep well. You have {$gold} gold left.
-> Just information.
    Innkeeper: Information is cheaper. What do you want to know?
-> Nothing, sorry. <<if $gold > 100>>
    Innkeeper: Suit yourself, moneybags.

Innkeeper: Mind the step on your way out.
===
